{\pard\plain\posx934\posy9984\absw5608\absh0\dxfrtext0\dfrmtxtx0\dfrmtxty0\nosnaplinegrid{\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u119x\u104x\u101x\u114x\u101x }{\b0\i0\strike0\f12\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u120x }{\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u105x\u115x \u116x\u104x\u101x \u105x\u110x\u105x\u116x\u105x\u97x\u108x \u118x\u97x\u108x\u117x\u101x \u111x\u102x \u118x\u101x\u99x\u116x\u111x\u114x }{\b0\i0\strike0\f12\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u98x }{\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u97x\u110x\u100x }{\b0\i0\strike0\f12\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u121x }{\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u116x\u104x\u101x \u114x\u101x\u115x\u99x\u97x\u108x\u101x\u100x}\par {\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u118x\u97x\u108x\u117x\u101x \u111x\u102x }{\b0\i0\strike0\f12\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u98x }{\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u105x\u110x \u116x\u104x\u101x \u114x\u97x\u110x\u103x\u101x \u111x\u102x }{\b0\i0\strike0\f12\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u97x\u46x}\par {\b0\i0\strike0\f12\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0    }{\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u70x\u105x\u103x\u117x\u114x\u101x \u49x\u50x \u115x\u104x\u111x\u119x\u115x \u116x\u104x\u101x \u101x\u64256x\u101x\u99x\u116x \u111x\u102x \u97x\u112x\u112x\u108x\u121x\u105x\u110x\u103x \u101x\u113x\u117x\u97x\u116x\u105x\u111x\u110x \u40x\u49x\u41x \u116x\u111x}\par {\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u71x\u97x\u98x\u111x\u114x\u45x\u71x\u105x\u115x\u116x \u97x\u110x\u100x }{\b0\i0\strike0\f2\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u67x\u101x\u110x\u116x\u114x\u105x\u115x\u116x }{\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u102x\u101x\u97x\u116x\u117x\u114x\u101x \u118x\u101x\u99x\u116x\u111x\u114x\u115x\u46x \u84x\u104x\u105x\u115x \u119x\u105x\u108x\u108x}\par {\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u108x\u97x\u116x\u