{\pard\plain\posx934\posy11599\absw5608\absh0\dxfrtext0\dfrmtxtx0\dfrmtxty0\nosnaplinegrid{\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0    \u73x\u110x \u112x\u114x\u101x\u118x\u105x\u111x\u117x\u115x \u115x\u116x\u97x\u103x\u101x\u115x\u44x \u105x\u110x\u112x\u117x\u116x \u109x\u97x\u116x\u114x\u105x\u99x\u101x\u115x \u102x\u111x\u114x \u101x\u97x\u99x\u104x \u100x\u101x\u115x\u99x\u114x\u105x\u112x\u45x}\par {\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u116x\u111x\u114x \u119x\u101x\u114x\u101x \u98x\u117x\u105x\u108x\u116x \u97x\u110x\u100x \u116x\u97x\u114x\u103x\u101x\u116x\u115x \u115x\u116x\u97x\u121x\u101x\u100x \u116x\u104x\u101x \u115x\u97x\u109x\u101x \u102x\u111x\u114x \u116x\u104x\u101x \u115x\u97x\u109x\u101x}\par {\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u100x\u97x\u116x\u97x\u115x\u101x\u116x\u46x \u73x\u110x \u111x\u114x\u100x\u101x\u114x \u116x\u111x \u99x\u114x\u101x\u97x\u116x\u101x \u116x\u104x\u101x \u104x\u121x\u98x\u114x\u105x\u100x \u118x\u101x\u99x\u116x\u111x\u114x \u111x\u102x \u102x\u101x\u97x\u116x\u117x\u114x\u101x\u115x\u44x \u97x\u108x\u108x}\par {\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u116x\u104x\u97x\u116x \u110x\u101x\u101x\u100x\u115x \u116x\u111x \u98x\u101x \u100x\u111x\u110x\u101x \u105x\u115x \u97x\u112x\u112x\u101x\u110x\u100x\u105x\u110x\u103x \u111x\u110x\u101x \u109x\u97x\u116x\u114x\u105x\u120x \u116x\u111x \u97x\u110x\u111x\u116x\u104x\u101x\u114x}\par {\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u40x\u91x\u102x\u101x\u97x\u116x\u117x\u114x\u101x\u115x\u49x\u59x \u102x\u101x\u97x\u116x\u117x\u114x\u101x\u115x\u50x\u93x\u41x \u97x\u110x\u100x \u116x\u114x\u97x\u105x\u110x \u116x\u104x\u101x \u77x\u76x\u80x \u110x\u101x\u116x\u119x\u111x\u114x\u107x \u111x\u110x \u116x\u104x\u101x}\par {\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u110x\u101x\u119x \u99x\u111x\u109x\u98x\u105x\u110x\u101x\u100x \u105x\u110x\u112x\u117x\u116x \u109x\u97x\u116x\u114x\u105x\u120x\u46x