{\pard\plain\posx934\posy7601\absw5608\absh0\dxfrtext0\dfrmtxtx0\dfrmtxty0\nosnaplinegrid{\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0   \u65x\u100x\u100x\u105x\u110x\u103x \u116x\u104x\u101x \u99x\u111x\u108x\u111x\u114x \u104x\u105x\u115x\u116x\u111x\u103x\u114x\u97x\u109x \u100x\u101x\u115x\u99x\u114x\u105x\u112x\u116x\u111x\u114x \u116x\u111x }{\b0\i0\strike0\f2\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u67x\u101x\u110x\u116x\u114x\u105x\u115x\u116x }{\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u97x\u108x\u115x\u111x}\par {\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u105x\u109x\u112x\u114x\u111x\u118x\u101x\u100x \u116x\u104x\u101x \u99x\u108x\u97x\u115x\u115x\u105x\u64257x\u99x\u97x\u116x\u105x\u111x\u110x \u97x\u99x\u99x\u117x\u114x\u97x\u99x\u121x\u46x \u73x\u109x\u112x\u114x\u111x\u118x\u101x\u109x\u101x\u110x\u116x \u111x\u99x\u45x}\par {\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u99x\u117x\u114x\u114x\u101x\u100x \u102x\u111x\u114x \u67x\u111x\u97x\u115x\u116x\u44x \u70x\u111x\u114x\u101x\u115x\u116x \u97x\u110x\u100x \u77x\u111x\u117x\u110x\u116x\u97x\u105x\u110x \u99x\u97x\u116x\u101x\u103x\u111x\u114x\u105x\u101x\u115x \u98x\u117x\u116x \u97x}\par {\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u112x\u101x\u114x\u102x\u111x\u114x\u109x\u97x\u110x\u99x\u101x \u100x\u101x\u99x\u114x\u101x\u97x\u115x\u101x \u119x\u97x\u115x \u111x\u98x\u115x\u101x\u114x\u118x\u101x\u100x \u102x\u111x\u114x \u72x\u105x\u103x\u104x\u119x\u97x\u121x \u97x\u110x\u100x \u84x\u97x\u108x\u108x}\par {\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u66x\u117x\u105x\u108x\u100x\u105x\u110x\u103x \u115x\u99x\u101x\u110x\u101x \u99x\u108x\u97x\u115x\u115x\u101x\u115x\u46x \u78x\u111x\u116x \u116x\u104x\u97x\u116x \u102x\u111x\u114x \u98x\u111x\u116x\u104x \u71x\u97x\u98x\u111x\u114x\u45x\u71x\u105x\u115x\u116x \u97x\u110x\u100x}\par {\b0\i0\strike0\f2\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u67x\u101x\u110x\u116x\u114x\u105x\u115x\u116x\u44x }{\b0\i0\