{\pard\plain\posx934\posy10413\absw5608\absh0\dxfrtext0\dfrmtxtx0\dfrmtxty0\nosnaplinegrid{\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0    \u70x\u105x\u110x\u97x\u108x\u108x\u121x\u44x \u97x\u108x\u108x \u116x\u104x\u101x \u102x\u101x\u97x\u116x\u117x\u114x\u101x\u115x \u101x\u120x\u116x\u114x\u97x\u99x\u116x\u101x\u100x \u119x\u105x\u116x\u104x \u116x\u104x\u101x \u116x\u104x\u114x\u101x\u101x \u109x\u101x\u116x\u104x\u45x}\par {\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u111x\u100x\u115x \u115x\u116x\u117x\u100x\u105x\u101x\u100x \u105x\u110x \u116x\u104x\u105x\u115x \u119x\u111x\u114x\u107x \u40x\u71x\u97x\u98x\u111x\u114x\u45x\u71x\u105x\u115x\u116x\u44x }{\b0\i0\strike0\f2\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u67x\u101x\u110x\u116x\u114x\u105x\u115x\u116x }{\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u97x\u110x\u100x \u99x\u111x\u108x\u111x\u114x}\par {\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u104x\u105x\u115x\u116x\u111x\u103x\u114x\u97x\u109x\u41x \u119x\u101x\u114x\u101x \u99x\u111x\u109x\u98x\u105x\u110x\u101x\u100x\u46x \u65x\u115x \u101x\u120x\u112x\u101x\u99x\u116x\u101x\u100x\u44x \u116x\u104x\u105x\u115x \u105x\u115x \u116x\u104x\u101x \u99x\u111x\u109x\u98x\u105x\u45x}\par {\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u110x\u97x\u116x\u105x\u111x\u110x \u116x\u104x\u97x\u116x \u112x\u101x\u114x\u102x\u111x\u114x\u109x\u101x\u100x \u116x\u104x\u101x \u98x\u101x\u115x\u116x\u46x \u67x\u111x\u109x\u112x\u97x\u114x\u101x\u100x \u116x\u111x \u71x\u97x\u98x\u111x\u114x\u45x\u71x\u105x\u115x\u116x}\par {\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u43x }{\b0\i0\strike0\f2\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u67x\u101x\u110x\u116x\u114x\u105x\u115x\u116x }{\b0\i0\strike0\f8\cf0\fs17\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0 \u104x\u121x\u98x\u114x\u105x\u100x\u44x \u116x\u104x\u101x \u99x\u108x\u97x\u115x\u115x\u105x\u64257x\u99x\u97x\u116x\u105x\u111x\u110x \u97x\u99x\u99x\u117x\u114x\u97x\u99x\u121x \u105x\u110x\u99x\u114x\